# aidd / agent-generated artifacts
#
# aidd's project metadata lives on disk and is never committed (docs/reference/artifacts.md). It
# holds generated reports, run state and secrets as well as the blueprint, and a repository that
# tracks any of it eventually has history to scrub.
.agents/
/.aidd/

.claude/
.codex/
.windsurf/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
opencode.json

